  that occur over the course of this story  but this is not a story about the movers  and shakers  it's about the people just trying to  live in the world  if you're interested in some more key  details as to how i've approached  certain elements of this book  and you want to get that kind of  information before considering funding  me on this kickstarter i have  provided a playlist of author diaries  that i have put out  so far and there will be more on the way  as i continue to work my way through the  editing process which brings us to  what exactly are you funding well  at this point the book is almost done  it has been written revised repeatedly  it has gone through beta reading already  it is in the editing process  what the main thing that you will be  funding is to ensure a professional  level of presentation  so that means things like a  professionally designed book cover  a professionally designed world map and  the big thing illustrations i mentioned  that it was an illustrated novel and  i can't actually tell you why i had that  idea  but once i latched onto it i couldn't  let it go in my ideal world  i will be able to to pull together  enough to have an illustration for every  chapter  in the book but even if that doesn't  happen the main purpose of this  kickstarter  is to allow me to be able to pay fair  amount  to the artists that i am working with so  that we can have  an appropriate number of illustrations  of key moments and you can get a proper  visualization of the characters as they  are intended to be seen  while the main character of the story is  a young man in his teens  i would like to think that the story  will have appeal to a  fairly wide age range basically anyone  who enjoys fantasy stories and like i  said  is tired of the epic quest is tired of  the evil empire as tired of the ancient  prophecies  and you just want to explore a new  fantastical world and get to know what  it's like to be there  dreams of fire will hopefully be that 